{
  "uid": "nginx",
  "title": "nginx 连接与请求",
  "tags": [
    "nginx",
    "monitoring"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "请求速率",
      "description": "sum(rate(nginx_requests[5m]))：nginx 每秒处理的请求数（所有 vhost 合计）。取 5m 窗口是因为 telegraf 60s 才扫一次 stub_status。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(nginx_requests[5m]))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "当前连接 (active)",
      "description": "sum(nginx_active)：包括 reading / writing / waiting 三种状态的总连接数。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(nginx_active)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "丢弃连接速率",
      "description": "sum(rate(nginx_accepts[5m]) - rate(nginx_handled[5m]))：accept 了但没能 enter 处理阶段的连接。长期 > 0 说明 worker_connections 不够（error.log 里会有 \"worker_connections are not enough\"）。counter 在 nginx 重启时归零，rate() 会自己跳过这段。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(nginx_accepts[5m]) - rate(nginx_handled[5m]))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "cps",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "指标新鲜度",
      "description": "time() - max(timestamp(nginx_requests))：最近一次采到 stub_status 距今多少秒。telegraf 挂了、或者 127.0.0.1:9113 那个 status vhost 掉了，这里会一直涨。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "time() - max(timestamp(nginx_requests))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 300
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 900
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "请求速率",
      "description": "每秒请求数（历史曲线，和左上角那个 stat 同一个查询）。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(nginx_requests[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "请求/秒"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "连接数",
      "description": "active = reading + writing + waiting。waiting 是 keepalive 空等，它把 active 撑得很大是正常的；reading 持续很高说明客户端发请求慢（慢速攻击或大 body）。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(nginx_active)",
          "legendFormat": "active"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(nginx_reading)",
          "legendFormat": "reading"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(nginx_writing)",
          "legendFormat": "writing"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum(nginx_waiting)",
          "legendFormat": "waiting"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "accept vs handled",
      "description": "accepts / handled 的每秒速率。两条线分开 = 有连接被丢弃（差值见右上角面板）。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(nginx_accepts[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "accepts/秒"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(nginx_handled[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "handled/秒"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "cps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "累计丢弃连接",
      "description": "sum(nginx_accepts - nginx_handled)：自 nginx 启动以来累计被丢弃的连接数。只在 nginx 重启时归零，所以曲线应当是平的；出现斜率就去看上面那张速率图。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(nginx_accepts - nginx_handled)",
          "legendFormat": "累计丢弃"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
